From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: brcmfmac: pcie: Provide random seed to BCM4345 firmware

Apple's iOS AppleBCMWLANBusInterfacePCIe firmware downloader writes a
256-byte random seed and {0x100, 0xfeedc0de} footer immediately before
NVRAM for BCM4345, and the 43451b1-roml bacchus.trx startup code checks
for the 0xfeedc0de footer to seed its PRNG.

Use WCC_SEED for BRCM_PCIE_4345_DEVICE_ID so brcmfmac matches Apple's
boot contract and provides entropy to the firmware.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c
index 7c9f31d21a8e..c93b1a8e64d2 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/brcmfmac/pcie.c
@@ -2823,7 +2823,7 @@ static const struct pci_device_id brcmf_pcie_devid_table[];
 	}
 
 static const struct pci_device_id brcmf_pcie_devid_table[] = {
-	BRCMF_PCIE_DEVICE(BRCM_PCIE_4345_DEVICE_ID, WCC),
+	BRCMF_PCIE_DEVICE(BRCM_PCIE_4345_DEVICE_ID, WCC_SEED),
 	BRCMF_PCIE_DEVICE(BRCM_PCIE_4350_DEVICE_ID, WCC),
 	BRCMF_PCIE_DEVICE_SUB(0x4355, BRCM_PCIE_VENDOR_ID_BROADCOM, 0x4355, WCC),
 	BRCMF_PCIE_DEVICE(BRCM_PCIE_4354_RAW_DEVICE_ID, WCC),
